FIR No: 0733/2026   Cyber Police Station, Hyderabad   Date of FIR: 30/06/2026
Sections: Section 67A IT Act, 384 IPC, 66C IT Act
Complainant: Naveen Reddy, S/o Venkat Reddy, R/o Madhapur, Hyderabad (Ph: 9963 445 566).
Facts: The accused Pooja alias Riya contacted the complainant on Instagram profile @riya_hyd_99 and later on WhatsApp number +91 6300 998 877. She recorded a private video call and extorted Rs. 75,000 by threatening to share the video with his family. The complainant paid via Google Pay to UPI ID riya99@paytm on 28-06-2026 and 29-06-2026. Money was also asked to be deposited in bitcoin wallet address bc1qxy2kgdygjrsqtzq2n0yrf2493p83kkfjhx0wlh. Email used by accused: riya.hyd99@outlook.com.
Investigating Officer: Inspector Shiva Prasad
